 function howto(){game.screen='howto';show(`<div class="screen"><div class="card"><div class="topline">THE MANUAL (SORT OF)</div><h2>One button. Zero safety gear.</h2><p>Our brave little tin can starts with a <b>giant boot to the backside</b>. Off it goes!</p><p><b>Let go</b> to spin clockwise. More spins mean a stronger bounce. <b>Hold anywhere</b> (or SPACE / ↓) to brake and point feet-down before landing.</p><p>Feet first = big bouncy launch. Face-plant = <b>arms pop off first</b>, then legs. Lose them all and the next hit ejects your head like a flaming comet. Heads can still win!</p><p>Grab up to <b>4 chips</b>: win, spin, soar and go the distance. Spend chips on Jump, Spin, Stamina and Explosion upgrades.</p><p class="race-note">Tip: start braking near the top of your jump—not at the last millisecond!</p>${btn('GOT IT — LET’S ROLL','menu','gold')}</div></div>`)}
